10:Tc0e,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"CreativeWork","name":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』无伝 夕紅の士 −大坂夏の陣−","description":"360度回転劇場「IHIステージアラウンド東京」でのロングラン公演を締めくくる、大坂の陣プロジェクトの完結編。 慶長十九年、大坂。冬の陣を経て、歴史は「豊臣滅亡」という正史へ向かうはずだった。しかし、へし切長谷部率いる部隊が降り立った夏の陣の大坂城下は、豊臣軍の連戦連勝に沸くという、正史から大きく逸脱した狂乱の様相を呈していた。実在するはずのない「真田十勇士」の暗躍、そして解体されたはずの真田丸で彼らを待ち受けていたのは、三日月宗近の元主・高台院。大千鳥十文字槍と泛塵に課せられた極秘任務も交錯する中、刀剣男士たちは「物語」が歴史を飲み込もうとする濁流に立ち向かう。","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/plays/touken-ranbu-stage-muden","keywords":"群像のうまみ, 殺陣厚め, 刺さる/しんどい, 世界観つよめ","about":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』（刀ステ）","actor":[{"@type":"Person","name":"鈴木 拡樹","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/suzuki-hiroki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"高本 学","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/takamoto-gaku"},{"@type":"Person","name":"三津谷 亮","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/mitsuya-ryo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"北村 諒","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kitamura-ryo"},{"@type":"Person","name":"和田 雅成","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/wada-masanari"},{"@type":"Person","name":"近藤 頌利","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kondo-shori"},{"@type":"Person","name":"熊谷 魁人","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kumagai-kaito"},{"@type":"Person","name":"染谷 俊之","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/someya-toshiyuki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"小松 準弥","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/komatsu-junya"},{"@type":"Person","name":"一路 真輝","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/ichiro-maki"},{"@type":"Person","name":"風間 由次郎","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kazama-yujiro"},{"@type":"Person","name":"河合 龍之介","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kawai-ryunosuke"},{"@type":"Person","name":"牧田 哲也","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/makita-tetsuya"},{"@type":"Person","name":"坂口 修一","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/sakaguchi-shuichi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"竹村 晋太朗","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/takemura-shintaro"},{"@type":"Person","name":"高田 淳","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/takada-jun"},{"@type":"Person","name":"行澤 孝","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/namesawa-takashi"},{"@type":"Person","name":"久保田 創","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/kubota-so"},{"@type":"Person","name":"伊藤 教人","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/ito-norihito"},{"@type":"Person","name":"星璃","url":"https://stageconnect.jp/actors/shori"}]}5:["$","main",null,{"className":"container","style":{"paddingBlock":32},"children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$10"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"stack-lg","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"hero-card stack-md","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"Play Detail SSR"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"page-title","children":"舞台『刀剣乱舞』无伝 夕紅の士 −大坂夏の陣−"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"lead","children":"360度回転劇場「IHIステージアラウンド東京」でのロングラン公演を締めくくる、大坂の陣プロジェクトの完結編。\n慶長十九年、大坂。冬の陣を経て、歴史は「豊臣滅亡」という正史へ向かうはずだった。しかし、へし切長谷部率いる部隊が降り立った夏の陣の大坂城下は、豊臣軍の連戦連勝に沸くという、正史から大きく逸脱した狂乱の様相を呈していた。実在するはずのない「真田十勇士」の暗躍、そして解体されたはずの真田丸で彼らを待ち受けていたのは、三日月宗近の元主・高台院。大千鳥十文字槍と泛塵に課せられた極秘任務も交錯する中、刀剣男士たちは「物語」が歴史を飲み込もうとする濁流に立ち向かう。"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pill-row","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"className":"pill","href":"/series/butai-touken-ranbu","children":["シリーズ: ","舞台『刀剣乱舞』（刀ステ）"]}],[["$","span","群像のうまみ",{"className":"pill","children":["#","群像のうまみ"]}],["$","span","殺陣厚め",{"className":"pill","children":["#","殺陣厚め"]}],["$","span","刺さる/しんどい",{"className":"pill","children":["#","刺さる/しんどい"]}],["$","span","世界観つよめ",{"className":"pill","children":["#","世界観つよめ"]}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"pill","children":"配信情報あり"}]]}]]}],"$L11","$L12","$L13"]}]]}]
